WEBVTT

00:14:58.771 --> 00:15:01.014
with no instructions

00:15:01.014 --> 00:15:04.287
and let the children figure it out.

00:15:04.287 --> 00:15:07.934
And in a short period of time,

00:15:07.934 --> 00:15:10.032
they not only

00:15:10.032 --> 00:15:13.104
turned them on and were using 50 apps per child

00:15:13.104 --> 00:15:15.206
within five days,

00:15:15.206 --> 00:15:18.140
they were singing "ABC" songs within two weeks,

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:22.033
but they hacked Android within six months.

00:15:22.033 --> 00:15:25.551
And so that seemed sufficiently interesting.

00:15:25.551 --> 00:15:28.110
This is perhaps the best picture I have.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:32.261
The kid on your right